# The Owlbear panel is built, not written: every file in it is a copy of one at
# the repo root, with the relay origin baked in. Committing it would mean two
# copies of the app in the tree, drifting apart. Build it with
# `npm run build:owlbear -- --relay=wss://...` before deploying.
